WEBVTT

01:49.460 --> 01:54.930
[A Dream Within A Dream]

01:55.050 --> 01:58.030
[Episode 7]

01:58.509 --> 02:00.240
Then let's not talk about that.

02:00.390 --> 02:03.120
Ten years ago,
in the full-scale war with Dongshuo,

02:03.120 --> 02:04.510
5,000 soldiers from the Xuanjia Army

02:04.510 --> 02:06.590
faced 40,000 elite soldiers from Dongshuo.

02:06.590 --> 02:08.280
If Nan Heng hadn't charged into battle

02:08.280 --> 02:10.430
and taken the enemy commander's head,

02:10.590 --> 02:12.840
how else could we have turned the tide
after three months of losses

02:12.840 --> 02:15.040
and won ten years of peace at the border?

02:16.030 --> 02:16.800
What's wrong?

02:16.800 --> 02:17.840
Mr. Li, listen to yourself.

02:17.840 --> 02:18.560
What do you mean?

02:18.560 --> 02:20.680
How reckless Nan Heng was!

02:20.680 --> 02:22.079
5,000 against 40,000.

02:22.079 --> 02:23.190
What was he thinking?

02:23.190 --> 02:25.360
Instead of staying in the back
and commanding the troops,

02:25.360 --> 02:26.800
he, the commander,
ran straight to the front lines

02:26.800 --> 02:28.000
to steal the spotlight.

02:28.000 --> 02:29.400
Let me tell you, Mr. Li.

02:29.430 --> 02:30.870
Nan Heng…

02:31.000 --> 02:32.310
He, he...

02:33.190 --> 02:35.280
he might've had a few screws loose.

02:38.470 --> 02:39.360
You're right.

02:40.250 --> 02:42.360
He's definitely got a few screws loose.

02:42.360 --> 02:44.960
Otherwise, why would I
be telling you all this?

02:45.590 --> 02:46.920
Mr. Li, what did you say?

02:48.030 --> 02:48.840
Nothing.

02:50.240 --> 02:51.530
I'm just saying,

02:52.310 --> 02:54.079
everyone else is forgivable,

02:54.560 --> 02:56.690
and Nan Heng is always the one to blame.

02:57.750 --> 03:00.480
Miss Song, you really
see people for who they are.

03:00.800 --> 03:02.080
You're so…

03:02.120 --> 03:03.970
So sharp and insightful.

03:04.000 --> 03:06.000
I saw straight through Nan Heng,

03:06.000 --> 03:06.680
didn't I?

03:06.680 --> 03:08.010
I already know all that.

03:10.120 --> 03:11.870
Let me put it this way, Mr. Li.

03:12.390 --> 03:13.950
In this world,

03:14.150 --> 03:16.070
no one knows Nan Heng

03:16.430 --> 03:17.400
better than I do.

03:18.000 --> 03:19.000
No.

03:19.120 --> 03:20.360
There's one more person now.

03:20.360 --> 03:21.430
Guess who it is.

03:25.240 --> 03:26.310
I won't guess.

03:27.310 --> 03:29.140
We've arrived at the Song Residence.

03:29.140 --> 03:30.610
Goodbye forever.

03:33.030 --> 03:33.840
Mr. Li.

03:33.870 --> 03:35.150
Mr. Li, don't go.

03:35.870 --> 03:38.300
Think about what I said.

03:38.400 --> 03:40.730
Come find me
when you've made up your mind!

03:43.750 --> 03:45.150
Ambitious and ruthless.

03:45.460 --> 03:46.860
Cruel and heartless.

03:47.079 --> 03:48.540
Capable of any evil.

03:48.980 --> 03:50.440
Framed loyal officials

03:50.560 --> 03:52.360
and even harmed innocent women.

03:53.040 --> 03:54.430
In that wicked woman's eyes,

03:54.430 --> 03:55.620
I'm so despicable.

03:56.760 --> 04:00.010
Ambitious, ruthless,

04:00.040 --> 04:03.190
capable of any evil,
and framed loyal officials.

04:03.320 --> 04:04.590
That's what everyone says.

04:04.590 --> 04:05.850
I'm already used to it.

04:05.870 --> 04:06.800
But Your Highness,

04:06.800 --> 04:08.660
when have you ever harmed a woman?

04:10.240 --> 04:11.190
Go to Waning River Crescent.

04:11.190 --> 04:12.590
Bring Shangguan He to me!

04:12.960 --> 04:13.750
Yes.

04:15.180 --> 04:16.980
Did I say something wrong again?

04:17.269 --> 04:18.480
In His Highness's eyes,

04:18.480 --> 04:21.079
even that useless
Shangguan is better than me.

04:21.709 --> 04:22.240
It hurts!

04:22.260 --> 04:22.830
It hurts!

04:23.030 --> 04:24.510
Are you trying to kill me?

04:24.510 --> 04:25.310
Guihong.

04:25.750 --> 04:26.560
Guihong.

04:28.000 --> 04:29.620
I came as soon as I got the news.

04:29.620 --> 04:31.290
What happened?

04:31.630 --> 04:32.920
Weren't you off fighting bandits?

04:32.920 --> 04:34.450
How did you end up like this?

04:35.070 --> 04:35.930
Your Highness.

04:36.600 --> 04:38.000
Waning River Crescent's Hall

04:38.000 --> 04:39.860
might not be as simple as it looks.

04:41.700 --> 04:43.130
Li Shiliu?

04:43.159 --> 04:45.210
Was he really that Li Shiliu?

04:46.390 --> 04:49.070
My Lady, you're so lucky!

04:49.310 --> 04:50.120
Why?

04:50.510 --> 04:51.630
Is he that famous?

04:51.680 --> 04:52.630
Of course.

04:53.190 --> 04:54.360
He is

04:54.360 --> 04:56.390
the number one dream husband,

04:56.409 --> 04:58.390
voted by all
the eligible ladies in the capital.

04:58.390 --> 05:00.070
Always neck and neck

05:00.070 --> 05:01.530
with General Chu Guihong.

05:01.950 --> 05:03.680
Rumor has it he's cold and aloof

05:03.680 --> 05:05.240
and rarely shows his face in public.

05:05.240 --> 05:07.040
But today, he actually appeared

05:07.040 --> 05:08.240
and saved you.

05:08.430 --> 05:10.450
You must have been
a loving couple in a past life

05:10.450 --> 05:12.310
and still deeply love each other.

05:12.340 --> 05:13.430
Stop.

05:13.560 --> 05:15.430
You're hopelessly romantic.

05:19.720 --> 05:21.580
I rushed through the script,

05:21.720 --> 05:23.510
focused only on the main plot,

05:23.720 --> 05:26.250
and totally missed
such a popular character.

05:28.040 --> 05:30.070
Wait, is it possible that

05:30.090 --> 05:32.680
he isn't in the script

05:32.800 --> 05:33.970
and is actually

05:34.120 --> 05:36.250
a wild card who exists independently?

05:37.980 --> 05:43.940
[Li Shiliu]

05:43.940 --> 05:48.900
[Nan Heng] [Song Yimeng]

05:45.240 --> 05:46.560
What else do you know

05:46.560 --> 05:47.630
about his past?

05:47.630 --> 05:49.000
Tell me everything.

05:55.070 --> 05:55.870
What is this?

05:56.190 --> 05:59.480
"Famous Men in the Martial World—
Li Shiliu Edition?"

05:59.480 --> 06:00.870
He even has a biography?

06:01.240 --> 06:02.640
There's stuff like this?

06:05.210 --> 06:08.430
Miss Song sure has a sharp tongue

06:08.430 --> 06:10.290
and a unique way of seeing things.

06:11.510 --> 06:13.310
She made all of His Highness's
heroic deeds

06:13.310 --> 06:15.250
sound utterly worthless.

06:15.390 --> 06:16.310
Nonsense!

06:16.690 --> 06:18.970
His Highness just had a few slip-ups.

06:19.160 --> 06:20.830
Hardly even a handful of them.

06:21.500 --> 06:23.270
He got tricked once by a schemer,

06:23.270 --> 06:25.430
ambushed once by enemy scouts,

06:25.510 --> 06:26.940
and had his supplies stolen once

06:26.940 --> 06:28.340
and burned another time.

06:28.790 --> 06:30.990
They all happened when he was young.

06:31.420 --> 06:33.040
What's that supposed to mean?

06:33.040 --> 06:35.180
Are you saying
His Highness isn't young anymore?

06:35.180 --> 06:36.680
Quit stirring the pot!

06:37.070 --> 06:38.920
His Highness is in his prime.

06:38.920 --> 06:40.390
Sure, he's weathered a bit

06:40.390 --> 06:41.920
and has a few lines on his face,

06:41.920 --> 06:44.750
but he still does 80 push-ups a day!

06:46.240 --> 06:47.240
Back to the point!

06:48.040 --> 06:48.900
Your Highness.

06:49.060 --> 06:50.950
Mr. Shangguan
knows nothing about politics,

06:50.950 --> 06:52.950
so I must speak plainly.

06:53.360 --> 06:55.159
You've spent years
building Waning River Crescent

06:55.159 --> 06:57.510
to grow your power base in secret,

06:57.510 --> 06:59.830
gather intel, and prepare for the future.

06:59.830 --> 07:02.280
This identity of yours
must be kept secret.

07:02.360 --> 07:04.000
Even if you want to ally with Miss Song

07:04.000 --> 07:05.360
as Li Shiliu,

07:05.510 --> 07:06.480
there's no guarantee

07:06.480 --> 07:08.430
she won't uncover
your secrets and plans someday.

07:08.430 --> 07:11.000
If the Eighteenth Prince
and his men find out about this,

07:11.000 --> 07:13.480
it'll be too late to fix.

07:13.480 --> 07:14.360
Fugui.

07:14.610 --> 07:16.850
There is no free meal in the world.

07:17.000 --> 07:19.630
No risk, no reward.

07:20.160 --> 07:22.890
Still, His Highness
can't take the risk himself!

07:24.040 --> 07:25.000
Let me ask you.

07:25.870 --> 07:27.190
Do you have a way

07:27.190 --> 07:29.450
to break the rule
Song Yimeng mentioned?

07:34.000 --> 07:36.720
Since we can't break it, we use it.

07:37.310 --> 07:38.310
Don't forget—

07:38.310 --> 07:40.040
you attacked Chu Guihong tonight.

07:40.040 --> 07:42.100
How are you planning to clean that up?

07:47.590 --> 07:49.650
Why would a man from the martial world

07:49.750 --> 07:52.310
show up just to test out your weapon?

07:52.950 --> 07:53.900
Could it be that

07:54.180 --> 07:56.440
he's after the method of weapon forging?

07:56.870 --> 07:58.360
There's only one person

07:58.720 --> 07:59.920
who cares about that.

08:01.940 --> 08:03.060
So I suspect

08:03.930 --> 08:05.080
Li Shiliu

08:05.270 --> 08:07.270
is most likely working for Nan Heng.

08:09.070 --> 08:09.950
No.

08:10.310 --> 08:11.700
If that's true,

08:11.730 --> 08:12.790
Heng has more cards

08:12.800 --> 08:14.460
up his sleeve than we thought.

08:15.270 --> 08:16.270
And not just that—

08:17.110 --> 08:19.560
the bandit operation
was supposed to be top secret.

08:19.560 --> 08:20.310
But Li Shiliu

08:20.310 --> 08:22.310
acted as if he already knew about it.

08:23.160 --> 08:24.020
Your Highness.

08:25.240 --> 08:26.150
I fear

08:26.800 --> 08:27.600
one of our own

08:27.630 --> 08:29.560
might be Nan Heng's spy.

08:30.830 --> 08:31.630
No way.

08:36.580 --> 08:37.980
Don't scare me like that.

08:40.440 --> 08:42.169
Your Highness, calm down.

08:43.460 --> 08:44.690
It's all Nan Heng's fault.

08:44.690 --> 08:46.520
He's made me so paranoid.

08:50.510 --> 08:51.370
Your Highness.

08:53.320 --> 08:55.440
If Li Shiliu really is Nan Heng's man,

08:56.560 --> 08:58.400
we can't just let him be.

08:58.620 --> 08:59.480
Yeah,

08:59.480 --> 09:00.790
but the problem is, we don't even know

09:00.790 --> 09:02.840
if he's really working for Heng.

09:06.670 --> 09:08.870
I have a plan to find out.

09:09.670 --> 09:11.320
But I'll need you to help me

09:11.360 --> 09:12.390
carry it out.

09:12.390 --> 09:14.120
No way! I object!

09:15.080 --> 09:16.750
His Highness is far too noble

09:16.750 --> 09:17.870
to keep lowering himself

09:17.870 --> 09:19.440
before Song Yimeng.

09:19.550 --> 09:19.960
But…

09:19.960 --> 09:21.270
Even if you break the engagement

09:21.270 --> 09:23.150
between Song Yimeng and Chu Guihong,

09:23.150 --> 09:25.480
there's no guarantee
the Song family will side with us.

09:25.480 --> 09:27.320
But if we let the two families get united,

09:27.320 --> 09:29.390
I'm afraid before Chief
gets the method of weapon forging,

09:29.390 --> 09:31.080
he'll have already
lost his shot at the throne.

09:31.080 --> 09:32.510
Will you take responsibility?

09:32.510 --> 09:34.320
I won't just sit back and do nothing.

09:34.320 --> 09:35.150
Your Highness!

09:35.150 --> 09:35.960
Shut up.

09:37.560 --> 09:38.910
But Li Shiliu

09:39.080 --> 09:40.810
is just a wandering swordsman,

09:41.070 --> 09:43.340
while Song Yimeng
is a noble lady from a powerful family.

09:43.340 --> 09:44.800
It's hard to win her heart.

09:45.320 --> 09:47.600
That's why you should get close to her

09:47.600 --> 09:48.960
as a trusted friend.

09:51.150 --> 09:53.360
Chu Guihong is her fiancé.

09:53.360 --> 09:55.160
He won't take that sitting down.

09:55.670 --> 09:57.260
The moment tension starts between them,

09:57.260 --> 09:59.120
a breakup is only a matter of time.

09:59.360 --> 10:01.440
So His Highness has to swallow his pride

10:01.440 --> 10:03.080
and sow discord to ruin their engagement?

10:03.080 --> 10:03.840
Go on.

10:06.990 --> 10:09.670
This booklet isn't entirely accurate.

10:07.440 --> 10:09.320
[Detailed information on Li Shiliu]

10:10.970 --> 10:12.360
I think Mr. Li

10:12.480 --> 10:15.200
isn't just a cold-blooded fighter.

10:15.640 --> 10:17.120
He's actually quite kind.

10:17.900 --> 10:19.200
At Waning River Crescent,

10:19.200 --> 10:21.270
he's taken in a lot of homeless people.

10:21.270 --> 10:22.600
I saw them all tonight.

10:22.600 --> 10:23.960
They were all very nice.

10:27.590 --> 10:29.970
The flood three years ago

10:30.210 --> 10:32.510
and the war four years ago—

10:32.670 --> 10:35.240
those tragedies were caused

10:35.270 --> 10:36.930
by Nan Heng's power struggle.

10:41.030 --> 10:42.320
Song Yimeng,

10:42.350 --> 10:43.590
you're saved.

10:43.620 --> 10:45.240
You're really saved.

10:45.240 --> 10:45.960
You're saved!

10:45.960 --> 10:48.160
Miss, I don't understand what you mean.

10:48.750 --> 10:49.910
How can you not?

10:50.790 --> 10:51.730
Look,

10:51.910 --> 10:52.720
Li Shiliu

10:52.750 --> 10:54.750
founded Waning River Crescent

10:54.750 --> 10:56.580
and took in all those people

10:56.750 --> 10:58.600
who lost their homes

10:58.600 --> 11:00.040
because of Nan Heng's sins.

11:00.040 --> 11:02.040
Of course they hate Nan Heng's guts.

11:05.440 --> 11:07.720
No wonder Mr. Li

11:07.750 --> 11:10.310
kept asking me about Nan Heng tonight.

11:11.000 --> 11:12.000
So

11:12.360 --> 11:14.270
he was testing where I stand

11:14.600 --> 11:16.130
and if I'm truly committed.

11:16.820 --> 11:18.600
So what are you going to do?

11:18.600 --> 11:20.080
Pretend to hate the Seventh Prince

11:20.080 --> 11:21.200
and get close to her.

11:21.200 --> 11:22.670
With the goal of bringing Nan Heng down,

11:22.670 --> 11:23.790
I'll befriend him.

11:23.790 --> 11:26.210
What if the Seventh Prince finds out?

11:26.230 --> 11:28.140
What if your true identity is exposed?

11:27.910 --> 11:32.750
[VS]

11:28.170 --> 11:29.750
Then strike first.

11:30.440 --> 11:31.250
Kill.

11:51.330 --> 11:52.970
Chief.

11:53.870 --> 11:54.670
Here.

11:57.670 --> 11:58.600
What do you mean?

11:58.720 --> 12:01.750
The best way to build trust
is through a handwritten letter

12:01.750 --> 12:04.080
that fully expresses your feelings.

12:04.080 --> 12:06.270
It works wonders on women.

12:10.200 --> 12:11.510
I don't have time for that.

12:11.510 --> 12:12.600
I do.

12:12.770 --> 12:14.240
Don't be fooled by how lazy I look.

12:14.240 --> 12:14.840
I can

12:14.840 --> 12:17.030
write 80 love poems anytime.

12:17.240 --> 12:18.120
You?

12:23.830 --> 12:25.880
Fine. Do what you see fit.

12:26.130 --> 12:27.440
Don't worry.

12:27.470 --> 12:28.690
Leave it to me.

12:29.410 --> 12:30.810
You'll be disappointed.

12:31.730 --> 12:39.810
[Laiyi House]

12:32.870 --> 12:34.670
My Lady, My Lady.

12:35.030 --> 12:35.840
Li Shiliu…

12:36.320 --> 12:37.630
Li Shiliu sent a letter.

12:37.630 --> 12:38.440
Li Shiliu?

12:40.720 --> 12:41.900
I hope this letter

12:42.000 --> 12:43.390
finds you well, Miss Song.

12:43.390 --> 12:45.480
The flowers in the capital
are in full bloom.

12:45.480 --> 12:48.790
I've thought often
of our last meeting,

12:48.810 --> 12:51.550
so I wrote this poem for you:

12:52.780 --> 12:55.570
Spring brings flowers, autumn the moon.

12:55.630 --> 12:57.910
One glance at you, and I can't forget you.

12:57.960 --> 13:00.560
Red candles paired, birds in twos.

13:00.580 --> 13:03.690
My yearning for you is driving me crazy.

13:03.870 --> 13:05.200
What the hell is this?

13:09.130 --> 13:10.700
It's only been a few days.

13:10.720 --> 13:12.780
How did you get greasy
all of a sudden?

13:13.030 --> 13:13.980
Mr. Li,

13:14.080 --> 13:16.850
don't read weird books.

13:16.930 --> 13:19.320
If you're not picky about what you read,

13:19.560 --> 13:21.490
it'll harm both your body and mind.

13:28.720 --> 13:29.860
Guys!

13:31.290 --> 13:32.680
Second Master has given the order.

13:32.680 --> 13:36.200
We're compiling
the most popular storylines into a book

13:36.240 --> 13:37.150
to craft the perfect backstory

13:37.150 --> 13:39.360
for Chief in which he's handsome,
strong, yet miserable!

13:39.360 --> 13:40.020
Let's do it!

13:40.200 --> 13:43.440
Handsome, strong, yet miserable!

13:44.120 --> 13:46.200
There's no woman who won't fall for

13:46.200 --> 13:49.030
a man who's handsome,
strong, yet miserable.

13:49.200 --> 13:50.320
If there is,

13:50.320 --> 13:51.910
it just means he's not handsome enough,

13:51.910 --> 13:54.480
not strong enough,
or hasn't suffered enough.

13:54.480 --> 13:55.750
Bro, come, come.

13:56.600 --> 13:58.270
Come on. Don't copy that one.

13:58.270 --> 13:59.490
Here, copy this.

13:59.790 --> 14:00.240
Alright.

14:00.240 --> 14:01.120
Bro, come.

14:01.120 --> 14:02.270
Put this stack of books over there.

14:02.130 --> 14:05.460
[Graceful and Composed]

14:08.210 --> 14:09.270
"A Sigh Across a Thousand Years:

14:09.270 --> 14:11.200
Li Shiliu's 99 Brushes With Death."

14:11.200 --> 14:13.060
Yeah, that's the persona we want.

14:18.860 --> 14:20.240
[A Sigh Across 1000 Years:
Li Shiliu's 99 Brushes With Death]

14:23.580 --> 14:28.010
[A Sigh Across 1000 Years:
Li Shiliu's 99 Brushes With Death]

14:24.260 --> 14:27.070
He lost his father at three
and his mother at five.

14:28.510 --> 14:29.910
His only beloved dog

14:30.060 --> 14:31.700
abandoned him.

14:36.390 --> 14:38.080
He learned martial arts by himself.

14:38.080 --> 14:40.010
All his meridians were shattered.

14:40.480 --> 14:42.010
Then he rose from the ashes?

14:44.620 --> 14:46.480
Wait, when did I go through any of that?

14:46.480 --> 14:46.960
I...

14:46.960 --> 14:48.460
It gets worse.

14:48.520 --> 14:50.810
S-Stabbed 128 times,

14:50.840 --> 14:53.970
buried in an ancient well,
and rose again after 100 days.

14:55.720 --> 14:57.500
I'm just trying to help Li…

14:58.390 --> 14:59.600
to help you.

14:59.620 --> 15:01.390
Handsome, strong, yet miserable?

15:01.390 --> 15:02.200
Nonsense!

15:03.670 --> 15:04.670
Serves you right!

15:20.580 --> 15:23.040
Hope this letter finds you well.

15:23.170 --> 15:26.670
The rumors swirling around the capital
lately could break even the strongest man.

15:26.670 --> 15:28.320
I have no way to explain myself,

15:28.320 --> 15:31.120
but knowing you believe in me is enough.

15:32.470 --> 15:35.000
What other people
think of me doesn't matter.

15:35.750 --> 15:37.820
I've heard
court struggles grow fiercer by the day.

15:37.820 --> 15:39.950
General Chu
is now in charge of palace security.

15:39.950 --> 15:42.110
He may not have time to look after you.

15:42.240 --> 15:43.510
If you'd like,

15:43.600 --> 15:46.080
you're always welcome
to visit Waning River Crescent.

15:46.080 --> 15:48.280
It might help take your mind off things.

16:01.100 --> 16:02.930
What's Song Yimeng playing at?

16:03.010 --> 16:04.270
Your Highness, it might be poisoned.

16:04.270 --> 16:06.000
Let Mr. Shangguan try it first.

16:06.030 --> 16:06.840
I'll shut up.

16:11.910 --> 16:12.910
What do you think?

16:14.600 --> 16:15.460
Your Highness,

16:15.750 --> 16:16.870
Song Yimeng

16:17.680 --> 16:19.060
has taken the bait.

16:22.190 --> 16:23.100
Your Highness.

16:23.130 --> 16:25.930
A letter just arrived
from the Eighteenth Prince.

16:39.960 --> 16:41.670
He's asked to meet you

16:41.790 --> 16:44.190
tomorrow at noon
at Waning River Crescent.

16:44.840 --> 16:47.390
The Eighteenth Prince
must be out of his mind,

16:47.390 --> 16:49.520
asking to meet you outside the palace.

16:49.630 --> 16:51.480
Just days ago, Chu Guihong

16:51.480 --> 16:53.000
exchanged blows with you there,

16:53.000 --> 16:54.780
and today Nan Rui sent an invitation.

16:54.780 --> 16:55.810
Interesting.

16:56.450 --> 16:57.740
He thinks he's clever

16:58.210 --> 17:00.130
and even dragged Rui into it.

17:00.150 --> 17:01.780
Are you going?

17:01.810 --> 17:02.450
Yes.

17:02.790 --> 17:03.980
Opportunities like this

17:03.980 --> 17:05.119
don't come again.

17:05.240 --> 17:06.510
After his release from prison,

17:06.510 --> 17:08.160
His Majesty sent
his father's belongings

17:08.160 --> 17:09.640
back to the Qianyu Mansion,

17:09.640 --> 17:11.069
calling it returning them,

17:11.069 --> 17:13.530
but it was actually meant
to intimidate you.

17:13.680 --> 17:16.030
He thinks with that thing in hand,
he'll be unstoppable.

17:16.030 --> 17:19.119
Then I'll make sure he falls
and never gets up.

17:19.150 --> 17:21.200
Looks like Shanhu's thieving skills

17:21.200 --> 17:22.960
will finally come in handy.

17:23.020 --> 17:24.490
Maybe with that thing,

17:25.030 --> 17:27.490
we can uncover
the method of weapon forging.

17:27.510 --> 17:28.790
Wait, what are you talking about?

17:28.790 --> 17:30.390
Can someone explain it to me?

17:33.700 --> 17:35.600
The Qianyu Moon-Cleaving Blade.

17:36.350 --> 17:37.160
What?

17:56.720 --> 17:57.550
This way, please.

17:57.550 --> 17:58.680
Excellent, excellent!

17:58.680 --> 18:00.110
Truly eye-opening!

18:01.580 --> 18:02.470
Come, please.

18:03.240 --> 18:05.030
Excellent, excellent!

18:28.310 --> 18:29.360
Don't be afraid.

18:29.400 --> 18:30.550
Don't be afraid.

18:36.750 --> 18:37.760
Sir.

18:44.590 --> 18:45.400
Leave.

18:46.880 --> 18:47.910
Are you deaf?

18:50.030 --> 18:51.230
He asked you to leave.

19:07.860 --> 19:08.860
Guys,

19:09.400 --> 19:10.400
get ready.

19:16.740 --> 19:17.900
Miss Song?

19:18.400 --> 19:19.070
Miss Song?

19:19.070 --> 19:20.350
Why is she here?

19:26.110 --> 19:27.220
Guys,

19:27.920 --> 19:29.270
once we go in,

19:29.350 --> 19:31.610
mind your manners.

19:31.640 --> 19:33.020
Keep your voices down.

19:33.350 --> 19:35.680
Don't spook our general's future wife.

19:35.930 --> 19:37.440
Our general's happiness

19:37.460 --> 19:38.980
is in our hands now.

19:39.260 --> 19:40.210
Got it?

19:40.310 --> 19:41.400
-Got it!
-Got it!

19:45.030 --> 19:46.270
Place your bets. Hurry.

19:46.270 --> 19:48.400
Now's the time. Don't miss your chance!

19:48.400 --> 19:49.640
Anyone can place the bets!

19:49.640 --> 19:50.550
Anyone can bet.

19:52.550 --> 19:53.830
I'm opening it.

19:54.070 --> 19:55.070
Yunlong, Shanhu.

19:55.240 --> 19:56.050
Shanhu.

19:56.960 --> 19:57.880
Hey, you came.

19:59.570 --> 20:00.720
What a nuisance.

20:01.480 --> 20:03.220
Is your chief here?

20:03.680 --> 20:04.810
Chief?

20:05.090 --> 20:08.230
Didn't Chief say
he wouldn't be here today?

20:09.160 --> 20:09.960
He…

20:10.920 --> 20:11.850
Is he here or not?

20:27.910 --> 20:29.530
Why exactly

20:30.480 --> 20:31.740
did you invite me here?

20:33.050 --> 20:34.080
Why?

20:38.510 --> 20:40.280
Yeah, why did I invite you?

20:43.790 --> 20:44.460
Well,

20:44.640 --> 20:47.640
Waning River Crescent
is quite famous in the capital.

20:47.680 --> 20:49.910
Have you been here before, Heng?

20:49.960 --> 20:51.160
Have you been here?

20:52.110 --> 20:52.960
I...

20:54.720 --> 20:55.510
Wait.

20:55.530 --> 20:56.790
I asked you first,

20:56.790 --> 20:57.960
so you should answer first.

20:57.960 --> 21:00.400
I'm your elder brother. You answer first.

21:00.420 --> 21:01.080
That's not…

21:01.350 --> 21:02.160
You...

21:02.920 --> 21:03.400
You...

21:03.850 --> 21:05.690
Why didn't you play by the rules?

21:05.850 --> 21:08.010
I never play by the rules.

21:27.920 --> 21:28.760
[Be brave]

21:28.780 --> 21:30.960
W-What are you doing?

21:30.660 --> 21:31.330
[Be brave]

21:31.360 --> 21:32.500
What are you doing?

21:33.070 --> 21:33.960
What is this?

21:37.020 --> 21:39.280
Do you see me as some kind of monster?

21:39.870 --> 21:41.670
You're actually so scared of me.

21:42.640 --> 21:44.440
Don't tell me you invited me here

21:45.590 --> 21:47.090
because someone told you to.

21:47.090 --> 21:47.980
Nonsense!

21:48.160 --> 21:48.720
I...

21:49.300 --> 21:51.030
I was just practicing my calligraphy.

21:51.030 --> 21:52.550
Besides, I'm Great Jing's mascot!

21:52.550 --> 21:54.080
Why would I be afraid of you?

21:54.740 --> 21:55.660
Good.

21:57.350 --> 22:00.280
If something's on your mind, just tell me.

22:01.070 --> 22:02.440
Don't let others

22:03.440 --> 22:04.970
lead you around by the nose.

22:06.540 --> 22:08.020
N-No one's leading me.

22:21.440 --> 22:24.460
[Big Fortune]

22:21.490 --> 22:22.530
Miss Song,

22:22.680 --> 22:24.550
this is the first floor.

22:24.550 --> 22:26.080
It's called Guan Crescent.

22:26.270 --> 22:27.270
Watch your step.

22:27.750 --> 22:28.960
Why's it called Guan Crescent?

22:28.960 --> 22:31.090
Because it's the main business floor.

22:31.240 --> 22:34.310
Gambling, trading,
singing, dancing, dining—

22:34.310 --> 22:35.850
you name it.

22:35.850 --> 22:40.240
[Auspicious Clouds and Stars]

22:36.030 --> 22:37.640
It's also where Chief

22:37.660 --> 22:40.320
and the leaders
of Nightwalkers hold meetings.

22:41.120 --> 22:43.460
Go up these stairs,
and you'll reach the second floor.

22:43.380 --> 22:47.050
[Auspicious Clouds and Stars]

22:43.480 --> 22:45.340
The second floor's even more fun.

22:47.510 --> 22:49.360
Come on, keep up!

22:49.640 --> 22:50.400
Coming.

22:50.400 --> 22:52.270
The second floor is called Wang Crescent.

22:50.920 --> 22:53.350
[Unmatched Grace]

22:52.310 --> 22:53.720
There are guest rooms, private booths,

22:53.720 --> 22:55.200
and quiet suites.

22:55.350 --> 22:57.270
Every time Chief
makes a million-tael deal,

22:57.270 --> 22:58.460
it's right here.

22:58.550 --> 23:00.110
Look over here!

23:00.110 --> 23:01.070
Slow down.

23:01.070 --> 23:02.400
This is the third floor,

23:02.550 --> 23:03.880
called Cang Crescent.

23:03.960 --> 23:05.850
It's where the Nightwalkers
discuss top secrets.

23:05.850 --> 23:07.980
Normal people aren't allowed up here.

23:08.950 --> 23:10.220
I'm a normal person.

23:10.250 --> 23:12.310
-Guess I don't need to see it.
-No, no, wait.

23:12.310 --> 23:13.350
You're not normal.

23:13.350 --> 23:14.270
You're one of us.

23:14.270 --> 23:15.960
Feel free to look around.

23:16.230 --> 23:16.960
Look over there.

23:16.960 --> 23:18.090
That's the intel room—

23:18.090 --> 23:19.110
strictly off-limits.

23:19.110 --> 23:20.790
I'm telling you,
outsiders absolutely must not…

23:20.790 --> 23:22.030
Stop! Stop!

23:22.530 --> 23:23.630
Shanhu.

23:23.880 --> 23:26.140
You don't need to go into all that.

23:26.200 --> 23:27.510
I-I'm not that interested anyway.

23:27.510 --> 23:28.270
No.

23:28.750 --> 23:30.440
You're gonna be
the lady of the house one day.

23:30.440 --> 23:32.320
You need to know everything clearly.

23:32.320 --> 23:34.140
The more I know, the sooner I die.

23:34.180 --> 23:35.730
But Shanhu,

23:35.750 --> 23:38.100
you've been
dragging me around for an hour.

23:38.100 --> 23:39.240
When can I

23:39.240 --> 23:41.000
see your chief?

23:43.350 --> 23:44.440
It's the Second Master's order.

23:44.440 --> 23:45.400
He said I must help you

23:45.400 --> 23:47.750
understand the full
workings of the Nightwalkers

23:47.750 --> 23:49.400
and make you feel at home.

23:49.400 --> 23:51.530
Now, I'll take you to the fourth floor.

23:55.830 --> 23:57.830
This is the fourth floor.

23:58.270 --> 23:59.880
It's called Wan Crescent.

24:00.510 --> 24:03.270
You can overlook the entire
Waning River Crescent from here.

24:03.270 --> 24:04.070
Look!

24:04.750 --> 24:06.030
This is the empire

24:06.030 --> 24:08.200
Chief built for you!

24:13.090 --> 24:15.130
So melodramatic.

24:18.530 --> 24:19.720
Besides this,

24:19.750 --> 24:21.240
there's one more place beneath the water.

24:21.240 --> 24:22.700
It's called Yin Crescent.

24:24.240 --> 24:26.110
But that's Chief's private domain.

24:26.110 --> 24:27.030
We don't actually know

24:27.030 --> 24:28.110
what goes on there.

24:31.640 --> 24:33.000
But don't worry.

24:33.030 --> 24:35.090
There are definitely no women there.

24:44.480 --> 24:45.270
Yunlong.

24:45.310 --> 24:46.110
Come with me.

24:46.920 --> 24:48.650
We're done for. We're done for.

24:49.950 --> 24:51.720
Miss Song insists on seeing Chief now.

24:51.720 --> 24:53.000
The way she looked just now—

24:53.000 --> 24:54.200
it was like she'd never leave

24:54.200 --> 24:55.970
without seeing him today.

24:56.240 --> 24:58.510
I finally got her
to rest in a suite just now.

24:58.510 --> 25:00.040
What's Chief doing today?

25:00.110 --> 25:01.440
Why can't he see her?

25:02.270 --> 25:03.280
I don't know.

25:03.880 --> 25:04.830
Wait, wait.

25:04.830 --> 25:06.490
Can't you help me look for him?

25:06.550 --> 25:08.830
Did you forget
what Second Master said earlier?

25:08.830 --> 25:10.720
He told us Nan Heng
would be here at Waning River Crescent,

25:10.720 --> 25:13.380
so we're to keep a low profile
and not act rashly.

25:13.880 --> 25:15.080
Some guests are here.

25:20.350 --> 25:21.420
Move, move!

25:21.790 --> 25:22.510
What's going on?

25:22.510 --> 25:23.310
What's happening?

25:23.310 --> 25:24.510
What's going on?

25:26.160 --> 25:27.440
Go, go.

25:29.480 --> 25:31.740
The Qianyu Army is here to make an arrest!

25:31.830 --> 25:33.130
No one leaves!

25:33.310 --> 25:34.410
What's happening?

25:34.480 --> 25:35.270
What's going on?

25:35.270 --> 25:36.350
No idea.

25:36.660 --> 25:37.870
No idea.

25:38.270 --> 25:40.250
Yeah, what's going on?

25:47.240 --> 25:52.380
[Big Fortune]

25:47.590 --> 25:48.240
Get up there!

25:48.240 --> 25:49.590
Hurry! Move!

25:50.310 --> 25:51.030
Stand still.

25:51.030 --> 25:53.790
All of you, stay right where you are!

25:55.810 --> 25:57.040
Sir,

25:57.110 --> 25:59.230
may I ask who you're here to arrest?

26:04.830 --> 26:06.720
-Who's that?
-No idea.

26:06.750 --> 26:08.280
I've never seen him before.

26:16.590 --> 26:17.400
Nan Rui.

26:18.350 --> 26:19.950
If you keep eating like this,

26:19.980 --> 26:21.840
I won't be able to see you anymore.

26:22.850 --> 26:25.160
Even if I stop, you still can't see me.

26:28.590 --> 26:29.400
Who is it?

26:30.350 --> 26:31.160
Come in!

26:35.750 --> 26:37.750
Greetings, Your Highnesses.

26:40.260 --> 26:42.150
Great to see you, Rong Hua!

26:42.720 --> 26:44.280
What are you doing here?

26:44.440 --> 26:45.440
Your Highness.

26:45.550 --> 26:48.310
I'm here with the Qianyu Army
to make an arrest.

26:48.330 --> 26:50.000
I ran into Jixiang

26:50.110 --> 26:52.000
and heard you were both here,

26:52.000 --> 26:52.790
so I came

26:53.590 --> 26:54.640
to greet you.

26:55.160 --> 26:57.160
Who are you here to arrest?

26:57.200 --> 26:58.920
The chief of Waning River Crescent—

26:58.920 --> 26:59.720
Li Shiliu.

27:03.920 --> 27:06.810
Then what does this Li Shiliu look like?

27:11.940 --> 27:14.720
What exactly did he do

27:14.720 --> 27:17.880
to make you
bring so many people to arrest him?

27:17.880 --> 27:20.030
Military equipment has been
going missing now and then.

27:20.030 --> 27:22.450
We suspect the Nightwalkers are involved.

27:22.510 --> 27:24.960
So we set a trap to lure him out.

27:25.110 --> 27:26.750
Less than two hours ago,

27:26.750 --> 27:28.240
someone took the bait.

27:28.270 --> 27:30.400
That person was Li Shiliu.

27:31.870 --> 27:33.550
There are so many of you,

27:33.550 --> 27:35.270
yet you still haven't caught him?

27:35.270 --> 27:36.920
That guy is extremely cunning.

27:36.920 --> 27:38.680
Even surrounded by dozens,

27:38.830 --> 27:41.160
he still managed
to slip away and flee here.

27:41.160 --> 27:41.960
However,

27:42.310 --> 27:44.640
he's badly injured and can't move easily.

27:44.880 --> 27:47.680
We believe
he's hiding somewhere in this building.

27:47.680 --> 27:49.310
We've already captured two of his men

27:49.310 --> 27:51.110
and are interrogating them now.

27:51.440 --> 27:53.070
If you do catch him,

27:53.070 --> 27:55.270
you must come report it to me.

27:55.270 --> 27:56.030
Yes.

27:57.030 --> 27:58.160
I'll take my leave.

28:17.680 --> 28:19.340
Li Shiliu's in this building.

28:20.050 --> 28:21.170
Aren't you afraid?

28:21.550 --> 28:22.350
No.

28:26.070 --> 28:27.850
No way I'm not afraid.

28:28.430 --> 28:30.200
A bloodthirsty killer

28:30.200 --> 28:31.240
is hiding somewhere near me.

28:31.240 --> 28:32.590
I'm terrified!

28:36.610 --> 28:38.450
Then call Jixiang in.

28:39.550 --> 28:40.350
Jixiang?

28:42.570 --> 28:43.820
Well, he…

28:44.030 --> 28:46.210
he's, um… a gambling addict.

28:46.330 --> 28:47.590
He snuck off to gamble.

28:50.070 --> 28:51.530
That's strange.

28:51.560 --> 28:54.090
Jixiang is always glued to your side.

28:54.160 --> 28:55.790
Why is it that today of all days,

28:55.790 --> 28:57.750
he left you alone to meet with me?

28:58.310 --> 28:59.110
He...

28:59.710 --> 29:00.510
I...

29:01.880 --> 29:02.680
You...

29:03.940 --> 29:05.920
Have some sunflower seeds.

29:05.920 --> 29:07.780
We have nothing else to do anyway.

29:24.790 --> 29:26.820
By then, I'll barge into your room

29:26.850 --> 29:28.110
disguised as Li Shiliu

29:26.990 --> 29:30.670
[One day ago]

29:28.110 --> 29:30.240
and pretend to be injured and pass out.

29:30.550 --> 29:31.480
Very exciting!

29:31.830 --> 29:32.640
And then?

29:33.720 --> 29:35.400
Then you come to check on me

29:35.400 --> 29:36.920
and try to remove my mask.

29:37.530 --> 29:39.970
If Li Shiliu really
is connected to Nan Heng,

29:39.970 --> 29:42.230
Nan Heng will definitely try to stop you.

29:44.310 --> 29:45.110
Got it.

29:45.660 --> 29:47.220
If Heng dares to stop me,

29:47.240 --> 29:48.920
I'll inform Father immediately

29:48.920 --> 29:51.070
and get an imperial order to look into him

29:51.070 --> 29:52.730
and the Nightwalkers, right?

29:53.600 --> 29:55.440
His Majesty knows you're pure of heart

29:55.440 --> 29:56.440
and speak only the truth.

29:56.440 --> 29:58.170
He'll definitely believe you.

30:02.900 --> 30:04.350
But what if Heng

30:04.350 --> 30:05.830
doesn't stop me?

30:05.830 --> 30:07.440
I can't really pull off your mask

30:07.440 --> 30:09.160
and let him see your face.

30:09.240 --> 30:11.200
If Nan Heng doesn't stop you,

30:11.320 --> 30:13.840
I'll pretend to wake up
and leave the room.

30:14.200 --> 30:16.340
All you have to do is stall him.

30:16.440 --> 30:19.270
I don't know if I can stall him.

30:19.720 --> 30:20.800
Don't worry, Your Highness.

30:20.800 --> 30:24.000
Jixiang and Rong Hua
are standing by outside to back me up.

30:26.810 --> 30:28.750
But what if Heng really

30:28.750 --> 30:30.160
has nothing to do with Li Shiliu?

30:30.160 --> 30:31.880
Then all our efforts in this investigation

30:31.880 --> 30:34.030
would've been a wild goose chase.

30:34.030 --> 30:34.680
That's…

30:35.240 --> 30:37.680
If Li Shiliu isn't Nan Heng's pawn,

30:38.360 --> 30:40.220
we can use this opportunity

30:40.350 --> 30:42.430
to make him your pawn instead.

30:44.480 --> 30:45.450
And…

30:45.750 --> 30:47.610
how exactly do you plan to do that?

30:48.070 --> 30:49.640
I'll bring a shipment of weapons

30:49.640 --> 30:51.200
into Waning River Crescent.

30:51.200 --> 30:52.200
After I leave,

30:52.640 --> 30:54.550
Rong Hua will lead a search of the place

30:54.550 --> 30:56.950
and discover them
hidden in a private room.

30:59.070 --> 31:00.890
You're trying to frame him!

31:00.910 --> 31:02.110
Calm down, Your Highness.

31:02.110 --> 31:02.960
Hear me out.

31:04.200 --> 31:06.000
Once Rong Hua finds the weapons,

31:06.070 --> 31:08.800
the Qianyu Army
and the Nightwalkers will clash.

31:09.400 --> 31:11.200
At that point, you can step in

31:11.200 --> 31:12.750
and smooth things over.

31:13.110 --> 31:14.230
By doing so,

31:14.440 --> 31:17.270
Li Shiliu will feel indebted
and be willing to serve you.

31:17.270 --> 31:18.790
You can then persuade both him

31:18.790 --> 31:21.160
and the Nightwalkers
to choose the right path

31:21.160 --> 31:22.490
and submit to the court.

31:34.440 --> 31:36.330
General, Rong Hua has come down.

31:36.350 --> 31:37.680
It's time you showed up.

32:04.270 --> 32:05.470
Waiting for someone?

32:07.640 --> 32:08.350
No.

32:08.440 --> 32:09.160
Who could I possibly be waiting for?

32:09.160 --> 32:10.880
I'm just waiting for you
to say something.

32:10.880 --> 32:13.140
Then why do you keep glancing over there?

32:27.330 --> 32:28.580
Who are you?

32:35.400 --> 32:36.800
He looks like he fainted.

32:38.510 --> 32:40.570
He seems to be the one from the poster!

32:42.240 --> 32:43.750
Gosh, he's Li Shiliu!

32:44.610 --> 32:45.610
Really?

32:49.270 --> 32:51.160
Heng, don't be scared.

32:51.180 --> 32:52.400
I'm here.

32:52.440 --> 32:54.920
Today, I'm taking off his mask

32:54.920 --> 32:57.400
and seeing who he really is.

32:58.310 --> 32:59.110
Wait.

33:01.310 --> 33:03.400
Shouldn't you go out and call for help?

33:03.400 --> 33:04.750
C-Call for help?

33:04.790 --> 33:07.120
Rong Hua and the Qianyu Army
are waiting right outside.

33:07.120 --> 33:08.920
Ask them to come in and catch him.

33:17.400 --> 33:18.640
If you're too scared,

33:19.070 --> 33:20.070
I'll do it myself.

33:21.050 --> 33:22.200
Hold on, hold on.

33:22.200 --> 33:23.350
Be patient.

33:24.830 --> 33:26.580
Don't look down on me.

33:26.600 --> 33:29.200
He's already passed out.
Why would I be afraid?

33:29.550 --> 33:31.160
Today, I'm going to see

33:31.160 --> 33:33.490
with my own eyes
what he really looks like.

33:43.960 --> 33:44.750
Heng,

33:45.290 --> 33:46.400
I'm going over now.

33:46.400 --> 33:48.350
Don't stop me.

33:51.930 --> 33:53.410
Go ahead. I won't stop you.

33:53.680 --> 33:55.480
I'm already walking over.

33:55.810 --> 33:58.700
I'll pull off his mask soon.

34:00.070 --> 34:00.880
Wait.

34:02.980 --> 34:04.150
What did you say?

34:04.770 --> 34:06.280
I mean you're too slow.

34:06.310 --> 34:07.110
Walk faster.

34:10.710 --> 34:11.510
Alright.

34:18.420 --> 34:20.780
I'm standing right next to him now.

34:27.639 --> 34:29.500
I'm really gonna do it.

34:35.290 --> 34:37.280
What do you want? What do you want?

34:37.280 --> 34:38.070
You're trying to stop me.

34:38.070 --> 34:40.440
You're definitely
trying to stop me, aren't you?

34:40.440 --> 34:41.440
If you won't do it,

34:42.320 --> 34:43.110
I will!

34:52.800 --> 34:53.590
Get in!

34:54.679 --> 34:56.790
[Excellence and Distinction]

34:58.800 --> 34:59.670
Sir,

34:59.880 --> 35:02.070
may I ask if that big guy called Fugui

35:02.070 --> 35:03.150
is your attendant?

35:03.190 --> 35:04.000
What's wrong?

35:04.960 --> 35:06.880
He's so hot-tempered.

35:06.880 --> 35:09.610
He crossed
a high-ranking official's daughter.

35:09.630 --> 35:11.840
Please go check things out.

35:12.980 --> 35:14.380
An official's daughter?

35:19.400 --> 35:20.920
Didn't I tell you
to take care of everything?

35:20.920 --> 35:22.450
Why is Song Yimeng here?

35:22.590 --> 35:23.760
I only wrote those letters

35:23.760 --> 35:25.090
to bring her here for you!

35:25.090 --> 35:27.490
How was I supposed to know
she'd come today?

35:28.050 --> 35:28.910
Let me help you.

35:33.000 --> 35:33.690
You can't be serious.

35:33.690 --> 35:34.890
I've got it!

35:35.200 --> 35:35.900
It's stuck.

35:42.070 --> 35:43.630
I love my hair.

35:43.760 --> 35:44.550
Keep yapping

35:44.550 --> 35:47.410
and I'll shave your head
and send you to a monastery.

36:06.440 --> 36:08.810
[Fugui was here]

36:32.790 --> 36:34.520
Why isn't the general back yet?

36:41.760 --> 36:43.000
Why isn't he here yet?

36:44.710 --> 36:47.710
It's not like
there are traffic jams in ancient times.

36:56.190 --> 36:57.000
You...

37:00.760 --> 37:01.960
Why is Yimeng here?

37:02.240 --> 37:03.340
Mr. Li.

37:03.400 --> 37:04.750
You're finally here.

37:06.290 --> 37:08.420
You swordsmen are quite interesting.

37:08.510 --> 37:10.000
The front door is right there,

37:10.000 --> 37:11.960
but you just have to
climb in through a window.

37:11.960 --> 37:13.640
Men will always be boys, huh?

37:14.740 --> 37:16.540
How does she even know Li Shiliu?

37:20.920 --> 37:22.030
Why are you hiding?

37:22.030 --> 37:23.440
We're basically friends now.

37:23.440 --> 37:24.840
Don't be so shy.

37:26.180 --> 37:27.250
Mr. Li?

37:32.190 --> 37:34.130
Is Yimeng having an affair with Li Shiliu?

37:34.130 --> 37:36.260
Impossible. Absolutely impossible.

37:41.800 --> 37:42.630
Miss Song.

37:42.920 --> 37:43.710
Mr. Li,

37:44.190 --> 37:45.800
what's wrong with your voice?

37:45.800 --> 37:46.930
Did you catch a cold?

37:50.360 --> 37:51.400
I heard that

37:51.550 --> 37:53.550
you're engaged to Young Master Chu.

37:53.590 --> 37:55.190
So why are you acting like…

37:56.740 --> 37:57.740
like we're close?

38:01.070 --> 38:02.030
Sorry.

38:02.050 --> 38:04.170
I forgot you're from ancient times.

38:04.670 --> 38:06.100
Men and women should keep a distance.

38:06.100 --> 38:07.500
Got it, got it.

38:09.800 --> 38:11.840
Mr. Li, since you're here,

38:11.920 --> 38:14.030
let's get down to business.

38:14.880 --> 38:16.190
I'll get you some tea.

38:16.480 --> 38:17.670
Have a seat.

38:18.510 --> 38:19.510
Miss Song.

38:21.630 --> 38:23.000
Chief is here to see you.

38:26.100 --> 38:27.200
Miss Song.

38:31.880 --> 38:32.750
You...

38:35.440 --> 38:36.590
You teleported?

38:36.960 --> 38:38.170
What?

38:38.790 --> 38:40.290
And your voice is fine now.

38:46.630 --> 38:47.480
You guys talk.

38:47.480 --> 38:49.320
I've got something to do,
so I'll be going.

38:49.320 --> 38:50.450
Where are you going?

38:52.010 --> 38:53.420
That's strange.

38:57.840 --> 38:58.510
So,

38:58.810 --> 39:00.940
Miss Song,
what brings you here today?

39:02.360 --> 39:04.610
I've been a little bored lately,

39:04.840 --> 39:05.630
so

39:06.110 --> 39:08.320
I prepared some gifts for you.

39:10.030 --> 39:11.670
Much appreciated.

39:11.840 --> 39:13.480
But I've got something urgent today.

39:13.480 --> 39:14.710
Let's talk another time.

39:14.710 --> 39:15.500
Mr. Li,

39:16.400 --> 39:18.140
why are you suddenly

39:18.360 --> 39:20.190
so cold toward me?

39:21.120 --> 39:22.760
When was I ever warm toward you?

39:22.760 --> 39:24.930
Didn't you write in your letter

39:25.060 --> 39:27.200
that Chu Guihong was always busy,

39:27.550 --> 39:29.150
and you were worried I'd be lonely,

39:29.150 --> 39:30.320
so I should drop by

39:30.340 --> 39:32.470
whenever I had free time?

39:35.660 --> 39:36.970
I did say that.

39:37.480 --> 39:38.810
So enjoy yourself here.

39:38.970 --> 39:40.250
But I really do
have an urgent matter today.

39:40.250 --> 39:41.350
We'll talk next time.

39:41.350 --> 39:42.140
No.

39:42.550 --> 39:44.410
I have something more important.

39:44.670 --> 39:46.470
I want to talk to you in depth

39:46.710 --> 39:48.150
about Nan Heng.

39:50.130 --> 39:51.090
Nan Heng?

39:57.220 --> 40:06.360
[The master and his servant
care for each other.]

40:05.480 --> 40:08.280
The master and his servant
care for each other.

40:12.830 --> 40:15.150
His Highness just told me to get lost.

40:22.070 --> 40:22.880
I understand.

40:23.480 --> 40:24.580
Nan Heng

40:24.840 --> 40:26.190
is a prince after all.

40:28.440 --> 40:30.370
People in your world are bound

40:30.480 --> 40:31.840
to fear him.

40:34.000 --> 40:34.930
But, Mr. Li,

40:35.130 --> 40:36.810
have you ever thought about this?

40:36.810 --> 40:38.160
If one day,

40:38.310 --> 40:41.340
the feud between
the Seventh and Eighteenth Princes

40:41.480 --> 40:43.190
throws the whole nation into chaos,

40:43.190 --> 40:44.760
what should we do then?

40:46.480 --> 40:48.590
Going up against a prince is not easy.

40:49.440 --> 40:52.100
Miss Song, I need to know
what your trump card is.

40:53.070 --> 40:54.480
Song Yude is my father.

40:54.880 --> 40:56.840
Chu Guihong is my fiancé.

40:57.280 --> 40:58.340
Isn't that enough?

40:59.150 --> 41:02.880
Yimeng wants me to join forces
with Li Shiliu to go against Nan Heng?

41:04.170 --> 41:06.120
I need to know your full plan.

41:11.880 --> 41:13.480
If it's not airtight,

41:13.800 --> 41:16.230
I won't risk

41:16.230 --> 41:17.110
my men's lives.

41:17.920 --> 41:18.710
Goodbye.

41:18.870 --> 41:20.140
The Lantern Festival.

41:21.890 --> 41:23.550
During the Lantern Festival,

41:23.590 --> 41:25.850
there'll be a citywide
celebration in the capital.

41:25.850 --> 41:28.000
Everyone will be there.

41:28.180 --> 41:29.740
That day, Nan Heng

41:30.000 --> 41:31.500
is bound to make his move.

41:32.460 --> 41:34.860
He'll turn the whole city
into a sea of fire.

41:35.000 --> 41:36.730
Countless civilians will die.

41:40.230 --> 41:41.350
Mr. Li,

41:41.560 --> 41:43.220
if you're willing to trust me,

41:43.380 --> 41:45.700
help me stop Nan Heng.

41:46.540 --> 41:47.400
What do you say?

41:50.960 --> 41:52.240
The Lantern Festival

41:52.690 --> 41:54.370
is celebrated every year.

41:54.770 --> 41:57.150
People light lanterns
and pray for blessings.

41:57.150 --> 41:58.710
It's all routine.

41:59.150 --> 42:02.650
Why are you so sure Nan Heng will act?

42:04.650 --> 42:07.180
Exactly because it's routine.

42:07.860 --> 42:10.160
That's what makes it the perfect cover
for him to suppress rivals

42:10.160 --> 42:11.850
and pull people to his side.

42:14.920 --> 42:18.550
[Four hours earlier]

42:15.400 --> 42:17.260
The palace guards were punished?

42:18.590 --> 42:21.630
His Majesty punished them repeatedly.
That's no coincidence.

42:21.630 --> 42:23.590
I suspect he's planning
to hand control of palace security

42:23.590 --> 42:25.110
to Chu Guihong as well.

42:25.130 --> 42:27.000
If that happens,
both the capital and the palace

42:27.000 --> 42:28.030
will fall under the control

42:27.060 --> 42:29.750
[Gentle Breeze and Auspicious Clouds]

42:28.030 --> 42:29.990
of Chu Guihong and the Eighteenth Prince.

42:29.990 --> 42:32.510
Chu Guihong has only held
his current post for less than ten days.

42:32.510 --> 42:33.890
If he wants a promotion,

42:34.760 --> 42:36.820
he'll need some kind of achievement.

42:40.120 --> 42:41.470
The Lantern Festival?

42:41.530 --> 42:43.620
If he's put in charge
of the Lantern Festival

42:43.620 --> 42:44.830
and does a good job,

42:44.850 --> 42:45.810
he'll naturally

42:46.580 --> 42:48.230
get promoted.

42:50.070 --> 42:51.080
Mr. Li,

42:51.420 --> 42:53.970
I know you still have a lot of questions.

42:54.650 --> 42:58.000
But this time is different.

42:58.140 --> 43:00.230
If we don't stop Nan Heng,

43:00.250 --> 43:01.630
it won't just be Chu Guihong—

43:01.630 --> 43:03.150
many innocent lives

43:03.190 --> 43:04.790
will be dragged down as well.

43:05.150 --> 43:06.070
Mr. Li,

43:06.510 --> 43:08.710
you have a heart
that cares for the people.

43:08.710 --> 43:11.310
Are you really
going to stand by and do nothing?

43:12.070 --> 43:14.520
I haven't even made a plan yet,

43:14.550 --> 43:16.810
and Song Yimeng's already said all this.

43:17.330 --> 43:19.760
Could it be she and Chu Guihong
are trying to stir up chaos

43:19.760 --> 43:20.840
to frame me

43:21.220 --> 43:24.560
and give Chu Guihong
a political advantage?

43:24.610 --> 43:25.410
Mr. Li,

43:26.400 --> 43:27.510
think carefully.

43:28.110 --> 43:29.590
Hasn't Nan Heng committed

43:29.710 --> 43:31.370
enough crimes over the years?

43:32.960 --> 43:34.080
If you're hesitant

43:34.280 --> 43:36.170
because he's a prince,

43:36.280 --> 43:37.930
afraid to face him alone,

43:38.150 --> 43:40.360
I'll have Chu Guihong join us.

43:41.440 --> 43:43.840
The three of us together
can take Nan Heng down!
